  "section": "105",
  "quote": "The only security deposit that a landlord may collect is a rent deposit collected in accordance with section 106.",
  "reason": "Section 105(1) prohibits landlords from collecting any security deposit other than a rent deposit, and a refundable deposit held against potential pet damage falls within the definition of a security deposit under section 105(2). Because the pet deposit requirement conflicts with section 105, it is void under section 4(1)."
}

